{"page":165,"width":1888,"height":2773,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"TER","words":[{"text":"TER","x":1560,"y":310,"width":125,"height":36}]},{"text":"CPU 스케줄링(scheduling)은 다중 프로그램 운영체제의 기본이다. 운영체제는 CPU","words":[{"text":"CPU","x":351,"y":878,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"스케줄링(scheduling)은","x":449,"y":876,"width":385,"height":43},{"text":"다중","x":850,"y":877,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"프로그램","x":931,"y":878,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"운영체제의","x":1080,"y":878,"width":166,"height":37},{"text":"기본이다.","x":1266,"y":879,"width":142,"height":37},{"text":"운영체제는","x":1425,"y":877,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"CPU","x":1610,"y":880,"width":82,"height":30}]},{"text":"를 프로세스 간에 교환함으로써, 컴퓨터를 보다 생산적으로 만든다. 이 장에서 우리는 기","words":[{"text":"를","x":352,"y":941,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"프로세스","x":398,"y":940,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"간에","x":546,"y":939,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"교환함으로써,","x":625,"y":938,"width":212,"height":39},{"text":"컴퓨터를","x":853,"y":940,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"보다","x":998,"y":940,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"생산적으로","x":1079,"y":940,"width":168,"height":37},{"text":"만든다.","x":1260,"y":941,"width":108,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":1385,"y":941,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"장에서","x":1431,"y":940,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"우리는","x":1544,"y":940,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"기","x":1661,"y":940,"width":27,"height":37}]},{"text":"본적인 스게줄링 개념을 소개하고, 실시간 시스템을 포함한 여러 스케줄링 알고리즘을","words":[{"text":"본적인","x":351,"y":1003,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"스게줄링","x":469,"y":1002,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"개념을","x":622,"y":1002,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"소개하고,","x":739,"y":1002,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"실시간","x":902,"y":1003,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"시스템을","x":1019,"y":1003,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"포함한","x":1169,"y":1004,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"여러","x":1288,"y":1004,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"스케줄링","x":1370,"y":1004,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"알고리즘을","x":1524,"y":1003,"width":171,"height":38}]},{"text":"제시한다. 또한, 특정 시스템을 위해 알고리즘을 선택하는 문제도 고려한다.","words":[{"text":"제시한다.","x":352,"y":1066,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"또한,","x":509,"y":1066,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"특정","x":598,"y":1066,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"시스템을","x":680,"y":1066,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"위해","x":828,"y":1066,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"알고리즘을","x":907,"y":1066,"width":169,"height":37},{"text":"선택하는","x":1089,"y":1066,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"문제도","x":1235,"y":1067,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"고려한다.","x":1351,"y":1067,"width":143,"height":37}]},{"text":"과에서 프로세스 모델에 스레드를 소개하였다. 최신 운영체제에서는 실질적으로","words":[{"text":"과에서","x":414,"y":1130,"width":118,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스","x":554,"y":1129,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"모델에","x":708,"y":1129,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"스레드를","x":828,"y":1130,"width":136,"height":36},{"text":"소개하였다.","x":981,"y":1129,"width":178,"height":38},{"text":"최신","x":1181,"y":1129,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"운영체제에서는","x":1264,"y":1130,"width":243,"height":38},{"text":"실질적으로","x":1525,"y":1130,"width":171,"height":38}]},{"text":"운영체제는 프로세스가 아니라 커널 수준 스레드를 스게줄 한다. 그러나 “프로세스 스게","words":[{"text":"운영체제는","x":352,"y":1194,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스가","x":534,"y":1192,"width":170,"height":39},{"text":"아니라","x":718,"y":1193,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"커널","x":834,"y":1193,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"수준","x":913,"y":1194,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"스레드를","x":994,"y":1192,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"스게줄","x":1143,"y":1193,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":1256,"y":1194,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"그러나","x":1348,"y":1195,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"“프로세스","x":1464,"y":1194,"width":151,"height":38},{"text":"스게","x":1629,"y":1193,"width":65,"height":39}]},{"text":"줄링\"과 “스레드 스케줄링” 용어는 상호 교환적으로 사용된다. 이 장에서는 일반적인 스","words":[{"text":"줄링\"과","x":352,"y":1258,"width":117,"height":38},{"text":"“스레드","x":481,"y":1257,"width":116,"height":38},{"text":"스케줄링”","x":611,"y":1257,"width":148,"height":39},{"text":"용어는","x":774,"y":1257,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"상호","x":889,"y":1257,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"교환적으로","x":972,"y":1256,"width":168,"height":37},{"text":"사용된다.","x":1154,"y":1257,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":1314,"y":1258,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"장에서는","x":1360,"y":1259,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"일반적인","x":1515,"y":1258,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"스","x":1663,"y":1261,"width":33,"height":29}]},{"text":"커플링 개념을 논의하는 경우에는 프로세스 스케줄랑을 사용하고 스레드에 국한된 개념","words":[{"text":"커플링","x":355,"y":1323,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"개념을","x":470,"y":1322,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"논의하는","x":582,"y":1322,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"경우에는","x":734,"y":1321,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스","x":879,"y":1321,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"스케줄랑을","x":1028,"y":1321,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"사용하고","x":1212,"y":1322,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"스레드에","x":1362,"y":1324,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"국한된","x":1512,"y":1323,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"개념","x":1630,"y":1323,"width":62,"height":39}]},{"text":"을 가리기는 경우에는 스레드 스케줄랑이라는 용어를 八卜\u0026하기로 한다.","words":[{"text":"을","x":353,"y":1388,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"가리기는","x":401,"y":1387,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"경우에는","x":549,"y":1387,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"스레드","x":693,"y":1387,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"스케줄랑이라는","x":807,"y":1387,"width":241,"height":39},{"text":"용어를","x":1059,"y":1386,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"八卜\u0026하기로","x":1172,"y":1386,"width":169,"height":39},{"text":"한다.","x":1354,"y":1388,"width":75,"height":39}]},{"text":"마찬가지로 1장에서 고어가 CPU의 기본 계산 단위이며 프로세스가 CPU 코어에서","words":[{"text":"마찬가지로","x":418,"y":1452,"width":169,"height":39},{"text":"1장에서","x":601,"y":1453,"width":115,"height":38},{"text":"고어가","x":734,"y":1453,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"CPU의","x":848,"y":1453,"width":112,"height":39},{"text":"기본","x":978,"y":1453,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"계산","x":1057,"y":1452,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"단위이며","x":1136,"y":1452,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1281,"y":1453,"width":171,"height":39},{"text":"CPU","x":1463,"y":1457,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"코어에서","x":1558,"y":1455,"width":133,"height":38}]},{"text":"실행되는 방식에 관해 설명한다. 그러나 이 장의 많은 예에서, 프로세스를 스케줄링하여","words":[{"text":"실행되는","x":357,"y":1517,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"방식에","x":504,"y":1517,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"관해","x":620,"y":1518,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"설명한다.","x":703,"y":1519,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"그러나","x":861,"y":1519,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":977,"y":1519,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"장의","x":1023,"y":1518,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"많은","x":1103,"y":1517,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"예에서,","x":1184,"y":1517,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스를","x":1306,"y":1519,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"스케줄링하여","x":1489,"y":1520,"width":201,"height":38}]},{"text":"\"CPU에서 실행”이라는 일반적인 용어를 사용하는 경우, 프로세스가 CPU 코어에서 실","words":[{"text":"\"CPU에서","x":358,"y":1582,"width":156,"height":39},{"text":"실행”이라는","x":534,"y":1583,"width":183,"height":39},{"text":"일반적인","x":733,"y":1584,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"용어를","x":880,"y":1584,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"사용하는","x":996,"y":1584,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"경우,","x":1146,"y":1583,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1233,"y":1583,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"CPU","x":1413,"y":1586,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"코어에서","x":1510,"y":1584,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"실","x":1662,"y":1585,"width":31,"height":35}]},{"text":"행되고 있음을 의미한다.","words":[{"text":"행되고","x":359,"y":1647,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"있음을","x":474,"y":1647,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"의미한다.","x":586,"y":1648,"width":142,"height":40}]},{"text":"이 장의 목표","words":[{"text":"이","x":404,"y":1788,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"장의","x":456,"y":1787,"width":74,"height":44},{"text"